# ESPF QM/MM single-point energy.
#
# System: a water dimer (water_dimer.pdb).  QM region = the FIRST water
# (PDB atoms 0,1,2); the SECOND water is MM (TIP3P point charges).  The MM
# charges polarize the QM density through the ESPF operator.  Requires the
# optional OpenMM backend (pip install openmm).
#
# The geometry is the PDB plus the 0-based QM atom selection; qmmm(...) both
# turns QM/MM on and carries the MM settings.
rks/bhhlyp/6-31g* qmmm(forcefield_files="tip3p.xml")
geom="water_dimer.pdb 0 1 2"
